msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这里……⟪k:1⟫以前应该没有锁啊……"

#: search2:search2_0FB7C85A_64C1_4CE4_AB67_F029F2EE8EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd59f9b6d345727244f495ba90b0c5719232703bd5ad40539dfed309379f58ca
