msgctxt "search2:search2_0FB7C85A_64C1_4CE4_AB67_F029F2EE8EE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Lustrous black chains seal the metal door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫泛着黑光的锁链牢牢封住了那扇铁门。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不管是在我生前，⟪k:3⟫还是在吉赛儿作为「馆中女仆」"
"牵着我的时候——"

#: search2:search2_CE0D7F82_7EA3_4CEF_8BCA_130F0610B5AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9bb23c329f7da86858678ef27399cede0de5ced6f27cefc0529764206272404
#. default-sha256: f5c730589eafa691aa0fc1b6dbf51c47972658f6f7e5425381ba87878d06408a
